[12:13.08]track [træk]n. 足迹，轨迹，踪迹；某事的进程；行程 v. 跟踪，追踪 例 Born on the wrong side of the tracks, he owned a company through personal efforts and determination. 搭 keep track of 与…保持联系；记录 / lose track of 失去与…的联系；不能跟上…的进展 / wrong side of the tracks 贫民区
