[13:27.60]dossier [ˈdɒsɪeɪ]n. 档案；卷宗 例 He is appointed to be responsible for maintaining the registration dossier. 搭 dossier on 关于…的档案
[13:40.20]hinder [ˈhɪndə(r)]vt. 阻碍；打扰 vi. 成为阻碍 例 The reformers have been calling for a rollback of rules that hinder law enforcement. 搭 hinder from 妨碍，阻止
