[14:03.48]venal [ˈviːnl]a. 贪污的；贿赂的
[14:06.12]writeoff [ˈraɪtɒf]n. 销账；(账目)价值降低 bar chart 条状图 例 This bar chart shows the sales figures of clothing stores in 2012.
